 /> <br /></p> <h2><span>狂风，啸纸喷墨-艺术作品合集</span></h2> <hr /> <h3><span><a target="_blank" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/happystormzhangart">至狂风呼啸处 风的艺作</a></span></h3> <p><br /> <br /> <br /></p> <p>▶————————————————————————————————————————————————————◀<br /></p> </div> <br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/h-storm-z" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4761754&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607238861" alt="H-Storm Z" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4761754)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/h-storm-z" >H-Storm Z</a></span>：请将你的一切倾诉写在信纸中，风会聆听。<br /> <br /> 在恭喜风风喜提人事页的同时，我开始思考为什么自己到现在还没有人事页，难道是我不会写小短篇的原因？——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/carter-lu" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6331978&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607238861" alt="carter lu" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6331978)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/carter-lu" >carter lu</a></span><br /> <br /> 你鸽了一年来着吧&#8230;——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/artcgb" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4847732&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607238861" alt="ARtcgb" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4847732)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/artcgb" >ARtcgb</a></span><br /> <br /> 恭喜风风喜提人事！我的还遥遥无期……（哭）——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/confucian-lee" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6591621&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607238861" alt="Confucian Lee" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6591621)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/confucian-lee" >Confucian Lee</a></span><br /> <br /> ▶——————